{"id":"b2b82e142840e429","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-open-closed-closure.md","title":"Theorem — 开闭拓扑的闭包公式","display":"Theorem — 开闭拓扑的闭包公式","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-open-closed-closure","aliases":["14-thm-open-closed-closure"],"display":"Theorem — 开闭拓扑的闭包公式","source_ref":"IX.4, p.486 (10),(12), DjVu249 left; V.1 closure reconstructed","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-open-closed-topologies]]","[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology]]","[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure]]","[[14-thm-subobject-heyting-algebra]]","[[14-df-subobject-lattice-operations]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-open-closed-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-open-closed-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 开闭拓扑的闭包公式"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"IX.4, p.486 (10),(12), DjVu249 left; V.1 closure reconstructed"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"46d4e2094b01f6d4\" href=\"?note=46d4e2094b01f6d4\" title=\"14-df-open-closed-topologies\">14-df-open-closed-topologies</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4b8f9443a0ee72c6\" href=\"?note=4b8f9443a0ee72c6\" title=\"14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology\">14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f2ca2aad80752c90\" href=\"?note=f2ca2aad80752c90\" title=\"14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure\">14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5aa17e379c0e3bc4\" href=\"?note=5aa17e379c0e3bc4\" title=\"14-thm-subobject-heyting-algebra\">14-thm-subobject-heyting-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1289398555ba3eed\" href=\"?note=1289398555ba3eed\" title=\"14-df-subobject-lattice-operations\">14-df-subobject-lattice-operations</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"46d4e2094b01f6d4\" href=\"?note=46d4e2094b01f6d4\" title=\"14-df-open-closed-topologies\">14-df-open-closed-topologies</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E,m,U_X,j_U^{\\mathrm o},j_U^{\\mathrm c}\">\\(\\mathcal E,m,U_X,j_U^{\\mathrm o},j_U^{\\mathrm c}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的任意子对象；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cl}_j\">\\(\\mathrm{Cl}_j\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f2ca2aad80752c90\" href=\"?note=f2ca2aad80752c90\" title=\"14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure\">14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow_X,\\vee_X\">\\(\\Rightarrow_X,\\vee_X\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1289398555ba3eed\" href=\"?note=1289398555ba3eed\" title=\"14-df-subobject-lattice-operations\">14-df-subobject-lattice-operations</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsLTTopology}(j_U^{\\mathrm o})\\land\\operatorname{IsLTTopology}(j_U^{\\mathrm c}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsLTTopology}(j_U^{\\mathrm o})\\land\\operatorname{IsLTTopology}(j_U^{\\mathrm c}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\\quad \\bigl(\\mathrm{Cl}_{j_U^{\\mathrm o}}(A)=(U_X\\Rightarrow_X A)\\land\\mathrm{Cl}_{j_U^{\\mathrm c}}(A)=U_X\\vee_X A\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\\quad \\bigl(\\mathrm{Cl}_{j_U^{\\mathrm o}}(A)=(U_X\\Rightarrow_X A)\\land\\mathrm{Cl}_{j_U^{\\mathrm c}}(A)=U_X\\vee_X A\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>在任意 Heyting 代数中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\Rightarrow1=1\">\\(a\\Rightarrow1=1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\Rightarrow(a\\Rightarrow b)=a\\Rightarrow b\">\\(a\\Rightarrow(a\\Rightarrow b)=a\\Rightarrow b\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\Rightarrow(-)\">\\(a\\Rightarrow(-)\\)</span> 保持二元交；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\vee(-)\">\\(a\\vee(-)\\)</span> 保顶、幂等且由分配律保持二元交。对全部广义真值应用这些恒等式，取参数对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\times\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\times\\Omega\\)</span> 即得到 LT 箭头方程。分类子上的蕴涵分类子对象蕴涵；拉回保持交、并及蕴涵，故两个特征映射分别分类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_X\\Rightarrow_X A\">\\(U_X\\Rightarrow_X A\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_X\\vee_X A\">\\(U_X\\vee_X A\\)</span>。这是实际推导，而非只以核的名称判断。退化检验：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=0\">\\(U=0\\)</span> 时开拓扑为恒真、闭拓扑为恒等；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=1\">\\(U=1\\)</span> 时两者互换。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-open-closed-topologies","status":"resolved","id":"46d4e2094b01f6d4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-open-closed-topologies]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology","status":"resolved","id":"4b8f9443a0ee72c6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure","status":"resolved","id":"f2ca2aad80752c90","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-subobject-heyting-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"5aa17e379c0e3bc4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-subobject-heyting-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-lattice-operations","status":"resolved","id":"1289398555ba3eed","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-lattice-operations]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-open-closed-topologies","status":"resolved","id":"46d4e2094b01f6d4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[14-df-open-closed-topologies]] 的 $\\mathcal E,m,U_X,j_U^{\\mathrm o},j_U^{\\mathrm c}$。$A$ 是 $X$ 的任意子对象；$\\mathrm{Cl}_j$ 见 [[14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure]]，$\\Rightarrow_X,\\vee_X$ 见 [[14-df-subobject-lattice-operations]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure","status":"resolved","id":"f2ca2aad80752c90","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[14-df-open-closed-topologies]] 的 $\\mathcal E,m,U_X,j_U^{\\mathrm o},j_U^{\\mathrm c}$。$A$ 是 $X$ 的任意子对象；$\\mathrm{Cl}_j$ 见 [[14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure]]，$\\Rightarrow_X,\\vee_X$ 见 [[14-df-subobject-lattice-operations]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-lattice-operations","status":"resolved","id":"1289398555ba3eed","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[14-df-open-closed-topologies]] 的 $\\mathcal E,m,U_X,j_U^{\\mathrm o},j_U^{\\mathrm c}$。$A$ 是 $X$ 的任意子对象；$\\mathrm{Cl}_j$ 见 [[14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure]]，$\\Rightarrow_X,\\vee_X$ 见 [[14-df-subobject-lattice-operations]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E,m,U_X,j_U^{\\mathrm o},j_U^{\\mathrm c}","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cl}_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\Rightarrow_X,\\vee_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsLTTopology}(j_U^{\\mathrm o})\\land\\operatorname{IsLTTopology}(j_U^{\\mathrm c}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\\quad \\bigl(\\mathrm{Cl}_{j_U^{\\mathrm o}}(A)=(U_X\\Rightarrow_X A)\\land\\mathrm{Cl}_{j_U^{\\mathrm c}}(A)=U_X\\vee_X A\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"a\\Rightarrow1=1","display":false},{"tex":"a\\Rightarrow(a\\Rightarrow b)=a\\Rightarrow b","display":false},{"tex":"a\\Rightarrow(-)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\vee(-)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega\\times\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"U_X\\Rightarrow_X A","display":false},{"tex":"U_X\\vee_X A","display":false},{"tex":"U=0","display":false},{"tex":"U=1","display":false}],"bytes":1969,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-187","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-open-closed-closure|thm-241 — 开闭拓扑的闭包公式]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-103","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-open-closed-closure]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-260","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-open-closed-closure]]"},{"id":"74d933333cdc3eff","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"这给出原书的开子 locale $U\\hookrightarrow X$ 和对应闭子 locale $X-U\\hookrightarrow X$ 的具体 frame，而[[14-df-open-closed-topologies]]、[[14-thm-open-closed-closure]]、[[14-thm-open-sheaf-exponential]]、[[14-thm-closed-sheaf-fiber]]、[[14-thm-open-topos-slice]]、[[14-thm-open-closed-complements]]研究的是初等拓扑斯中的 LT 拓扑、层对象与开闭子拓扑斯，类型和新增构造不同。"},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-52","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-open-closed-closure]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-182","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-open-closed-closure]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-188","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-open-closed-closure|thm-241 — 开闭拓扑的闭包公式]]"},{"id":"7b364b0997153626","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"反向，投影可逆意味着任意 $C\\to U$ 都有且仅有一个 $C\\to X$。闭稠密 $a:A\\hookrightarrow B$ 满足 $A\\vee U_B=B$。给定 $f:A\\to X$，在 $U_B$ 上取唯一箭头到 $X$，两者在 $A\\cap U_B$ 上相等，故沿满态射 $A+U_B\\twoheadrightarrow B$ 粘合。满态射是其核对的余等化子；核对的四个分块是两对角和两个交叠，所以相等条件恰好保证唯一粘合。所得 $B\\to X$ 唯一。$U=0$ 时判据对每个 $X$ 成立，$U=1$ 时判据恰要求 $X$ 为终对象，与[[14-thm-open-closed-closure]]的拓扑退化一致。"},{"id":"f255d6c7945bca41","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9b47287c9839ebc7","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["46d4e2094b01f6d4","4b8f9443a0ee72c6","f2ca2aad80752c90","5aa17e379c0e3bc4","1289398555ba3eed"]}